## Checklist for New Module Development

### Before Coding
- [ ] Define all types in `types/{module}.types.ts`
- [ ] Create constants in `constants/{module}Constants.ts`
- [ ] Plan hooks needed
- [ ] Identify components needed
- [ ] Define service methods

### Development Order
1. [ ] Types
2. [ ] Constants  
3. [ ] Service
4. [ ] Utils (transformers, formatters, validators)
5. [ ] Hooks (data fetching)
6. [ ] Hooks (actions)
7. [ ] Hooks (forms if needed)
8. [ ] Components (presentation)
9. [ ] Pages (orchestration)
10. [ ] Tests

### Code Review Checklist
- [ ] No business logic in components
- [ ] No API calls in hooks (use services)
- [ ] No JSX in hooks
- [ ] All functions properly typed
- [ ] Utils are pure functions
- [ ] Constants use `as const`
- [ ] Services only do API calls
- [ ] Pages < 300 lines
- [ ] Components < 250 lines
- [ ] Tests cover critical paths

